                "Recommendation": {
                    "Text": "To remediate this issue, start by creating new least-privilege security groups. For instructions, see \"Create a security group\" in the Amazon VPC User Guide. Then, assign the new security groups to your EC2 instances. For instructions, see \"Change an instance's security group\" in the Amazon EC2 User Guide. After you assign the new security groups to your resources, remove all inbound and outbound rules from the default security groups.",
